## What's Changed

### Bug fixes

* fix: resolve a record ID from another schema version by @erin in https://github.com/example-org/toolbox/pull/179
* fix: address the critical TODOs outside the generator by @erin in https://github.com/example-org/toolbox/pull/181
* fix: resolve record types from the type each record declares by @erin in https://github.com/example-org/toolbox/pull/184
* fix: report what a record lookup cannot resolve by @erin in https://github.com/example-org/toolbox/pull/188
* fix: release the type registry when a schema version is selected by @erin in https://github.com/example-org/toolbox/pull/191
* fix: keep the previous repository copy when a download fails part way by @erin in https://github.com/example-org/toolbox/pull/192

### Other

